Codebase summary for other agents
---------------------------------

This repository is a photo-sharing web app built with React on the front end and Express + Mongoose on the back end. It serves a MongoDB-backed experience where users can log in, browse other users, view photos, leave comments, mention other users with @mentions, and upload new photos.

### What each part does

-   [webServer.js](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/coder/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/e4c7e7b1d6/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html): Main server entry point. Handles Express routing, session-based authentication, MongoDB connection, and API endpoints for users, photos, comments, mentions, login/logout, and photo upload.
-   [photoShare.jsx](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/coder/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/e4c7e7b1d6/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html): Top-level React app. Manages login state and routes between the main views.
-   [TopBar.jsx](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/coder/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/e4c7e7b1d6/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html): Global header with app title, context label, photo upload action, and logout.
-   [userList.jsx](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/coder/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/e4c7e7b1d6/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html): Left-side user list navigation.
-   [userDetail.jsx](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/coder/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/e4c7e7b1d6/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html): User profile/detail page with links to that user's photos and mention-based photo highlights.
-   [userPhotos.jsx](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/coder/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/e4c7e7b1d6/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html): Photo gallery view with comment support and @mention autocomplete.
-   [LoginRegister.jsx](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/coder/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/e4c7e7b1d6/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html): Login and registration UI.
-   [user.js](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/coder/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/e4c7e7b1d6/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html) and [photo.js](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/coder/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/e4c7e7b1d6/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html): Mongoose schemas for users, photos, and comments.
